{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencelist\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"source"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is B-connected to ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or some hyperedge with ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" among its targets is entered along a path","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a vertex.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Complexity","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Hypergraphs"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11Hypergraphs13IncidenceListV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L383"},"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Every vertex B-connected to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"b_visit"},{"text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reachability.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/DirectedHypergraph/Vertex":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"title":"Vertex","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/vertex","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceList":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencelist","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList","title":"IncidenceList","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A directed hypergraph stored as an incidence list: each hyperedge’s sources and targets, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each vertex’s out- and in-hyperedges (Gallo’s forward and backward stars), as two planes of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UndirectedIncidenceList"},{"type":"text","text":"’s storage. Unprefixed, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdjacencyList"},{"type":"text","text":" is the directed one of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pair. ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":" is the matrix form; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":" is undirected, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“oriented incidence matrix” is the established name.)"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IncidenceList","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IncidenceList","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceList/bConnectedVertices(from:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Every vertex B-connected to ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"b_visit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reachability.","type":"text"}],"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier",